From: NixOS Android devices contributors <nixos-android-devices@localhost>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 20:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm: dts: constrain Clover firmware MMC to untuned modes

Local boot-only adaptation for v2026.10-rc5. msm_sdhci has no SDM660
HS200/HS400 tuning implementation; retain both eMMC and microSD with
52/50 MHz ceilings. ABL must leave the RPM-SMD rails enabled. No Linux
kernel DT or MMC capability is changed.
---
diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/sdm660-xiaomi-clover-u-boot.dtsi b/arch/arm/dts/sdm660-xiaomi-clover-u-boot.dtsi
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/sdm660-xiaomi-clover-u-boot.dtsi
@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
+/* Firmware-only constraints; Linux gets its own full board DT. */
+&sdhc_1 {
+	/* ABL supplies the RPM-managed rails; U-Boot has no RPM-SMD PD driver. */
+	/delete-property/ power-domains;
+	/delete-property/ supports-cqe;
+	/delete-property/ mmc-hs200-1_8v;
+	/delete-property/ mmc-hs400-1_8v;
+	/delete-property/ mmc-hs400-enhanced-strobe;
+	max-frequency = <52000000>;
+};
+
+&sdhc_2 {
+	/delete-property/ power-domains;
+	max-frequency = <50000000>;
+};
